  "description": "*“Don’t you want to know why I kept chasing after you like my life depended on it?”*\n\nWait… what the hell? Why is this guy here?!\n\nVeteran RPG gamer Choi Rim (in-game nickname: Cream) is constantly stressed by a newbie sniper, Pie, who doggedly pursues him to death. After taking a break from the game for a while, Cream logs back in for just a moment—only to receive a message from someone claiming to be Pie, asking to meet in real life. That’s when Cream decides to settle things offline.\n\n**Original Novel:**  \nVolumes: [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/3302017787), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/E000121438)  \nChapters: [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/E000136223)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/5290000080), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/player_love_kill)",
